ore, the linear transformation $T$ represents a stretch with a scale factor $2$ in the $y$-direction." 13194139535300 true] [17592186342573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342574 13194139535300 true] [17592186342573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342575 13194139535300 true] [17592186342573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342576 13194139535300 true] [17592186342573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342577 13194139535300 true] [17592186342573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342578 13194139535300 true] [17592186342573 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535300 true] [17592186342573 1041 "selection" 13194139535300 true] [17592186342573 1104 #edb/ref 17592186342574 13194139535300 true] [17592186342573 1110 #uuid "2f268e18-580d-5fcb-8b81-6e9d1c818b8a" 13194139535300 true] [17592186342574 1034 "A stretch with a scale factor $2$ in the $y$-direction" 13194139535300 true] [17592186342574 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535300 true] [17592186342574 1111 #uuid "ad32dc1c-d6e5-519e-ad3a-64466060a392" 13194139535300 true] [17592186342575 1034 "A horizontal shear with a shear factor of $2$" 13194139535300 true] [17592186342575 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535300 true] [17592186342575 1111 #uuid "91c8635f-aef6-5dfe-8684-c185c31accf1" 13194139535300 true] [17592186342576 1034 "A vertical shear with a shear factor of $\\frac{1}{2}$" 13194139535300 true] [17592186342576 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535300 true] [17592186342576 1111 #uuid "fa242814-002b-5051-ab32-2b4072df1c19" 13194139535300 true] [17592186342577 1034 "A stretch with a scale factor $\\frac{1}{2}$ in the $y$-direction" 13194139535300 true] [17592186342577 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535300 true] [17592186342577 1111 #uuid "6891c862-6f77-5b0a-845a-e7db65e7cb7f" 13194139535300 true] [17592186342578 1034 "A stretch with a scale factor $2$ in the $x$-direction" 13194139535300 true] [17592186342578 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535300 true] [17592186342578 1111 #uuid "1332c767-1678-5804-b680-ed62af259dab" 13194139535300 true] [1759218634